  "title": "LLDB 23.1.3 with isolated Python 3.15 for Ghidra, macOS ARM64",
  "redistribution": "Pinned Python-capable LLDB 23.1.3 Homebrew bottle closure, relocated inside owned distribution storage and ad-hoc-signed. Includes 99 native files, private CPython 3.15, full corresponding source for all bundled libraries, 68 source notices plus full Homebrew/core and SQLite public-domain notices, retained upstream build recipes and deterministic repacker/layout. No Homebrew install or Apple Python is used. Signed official LLVM 23.1.3 debugserver bytes are preserved. Requires macOS 15+ ARM64 and OS debugger authorization. Excludes Python readline/Tkinter/tests/IDLE, LLVM compilers/static archives, MLIR, sanitizers and unused CA data. Native acceptance is recorded separately. Revision 2 normalizes every symbolic link to its canonical internal target so the strict Node extractor never traverses a link chain. Revision 1 failed installation before native execution and is not selected.",
